   - gitleaks-tree: gitleaks dir over the export, the tree the merge writes, with the same flags, from inside it,
     so the config's ^-anchored allowlists match the paths it walks. It reads what a merge's resolution added, which
     git log shows no diff for. Anything at the export's root named .gitleaksignore refuses it first, since dir mode
