     it couldn't read, fails it too; it must say how many bytes it scanned, more than none of a tree with content;
   - arrival: spec 003's arrival check, the main tree's tools/gates/arrival_check.py, over $(git merge-base main
     SHA)..SHA: each commit's added and changed files as it had them, what each merge's resolution adds, and SHA's
     whole tree, read as git data, with the license allowlist, the approvals, and the caps read from refs/heads/main
